{"id":"n86984-1-8","stage":3,"title":"헤엄치다 · 游泳","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n86984-1-8-1","ko":"너는 바닷가 놀러 가는데 수영복도 안 챙겨?","zh":"去海边玩，你都不带泳衣吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"너는","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"너는","audio":"/audio/54abca9caefe5ae47b8e.mp3"}},{"text":"바닷가","meaning":"海边，海滨","explanation":"바닷가：海边，海滨。","readings":[{"term":"바닷가","audio":"/audio/edee03fff87eddb66cb9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"56428","senseId":"1","lemma":"바닷가","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"바닷가","audio":"/audio/edee03fff87eddb66cb9.mp3"}},{"text":"놀러","meaning":"玩耍，玩乐","explanation":"놀다：玩耍，玩乐；러：用于移动动词前，表示移动的目的：“去/来做……”。","readings":[{"term":"놀다","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88353","senseId":"1","lemma":"놀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"놀러","audio":"/audio/56ad7f4b97efb1434426.mp3"}},{"text":"가는데","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；는데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가는데","audio":"/audio/769c4e4621c06eaf653d.mp3"}},{"text":"수영복도","meaning":"泳衣，泳装","explanation":"수영복：泳衣，泳装；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"수영복","audio":"/audio/fd12c8d9d40ef1a1c56f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64612","senseId":"1","lemma":"수영복","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"수영복도","audio":"/audio/c60b0c18c4c63a842439.mp3"}},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不。","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}},{"text":"챙겨?","meaning":"收拾，整理，准备","explanation":"챙기다：收拾，整理，准备；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"챙기다","audio":"/audio/39b299d8d470abe5d844.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29778","senseId":"1","lemma":"챙기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"챙겨","audio":"/audio/3a3e7ad7b30bf414585e.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"edee03fff87eddb6","term":"바닷가","zh":"海边，海滨","audio":"/audio/edee03fff87eddb66cb9.mp3","entryId":"56428","definition":"大海和陆地相连的地方或其附近。","pronunciation":["바다까","바닫까"]},{"id":"8fc8305f6371680e","term":"놀다","zh":"玩耍，玩乐","audio":"/audio/8fc8305f6371680eeeca.mp3","entryId":"88353","definition":"玩着游戏等度过有趣、愉快的时光。","pronunciation":["놀ː다"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去，上","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"为某种目的而向某个地方移动。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"fd12c8d9d40ef1a1","term":"수영복","zh":"泳衣，泳装","audio":"/audio/fd12c8d9d40ef1a1c56f.mp3","entryId":"64612","definition":"游泳时穿的衣服。","pronunciation":["수영복"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"39b299d8d470abe5","term":"챙기다","zh":"收拾，整理，准备","audio":"/audio/39b299d8d470abe5d844.mp3","entryId":"29778","definition":"寻找所需之物并携带，或观察是否携带齐全。","pronunciation":["챙기다"]}],"audio":"/audio/84482a79ab255324f8ce.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n86984-1-8-2","ko":"나는 헤엄치지는 않을 거니까.","zh":"因为我不打算游泳。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"헤엄치지는","meaning":"游泳，游动，游水","explanation":"헤엄치다：游泳，游动，游水；지：连接后续表达，可形成对照；与 않다、못하다、말다 等合用时表示否定、不能或禁止；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"헤엄치다","audio":"/audio/f3901b179742f736c701.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"86984","senseId":"1","lemma":"헤엄치다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"헤엄치지는","audio":"/audio/90e436122b7192ec5658.mp3"}},{"text":"않을","meaning":"不","explanation":"않다：不；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"않다","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17186","senseId":"1","lemma":"않다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"않을","audio":"/audio/7a51c9ffaf26fb26b574.mp3"}},{"text":"거니까.","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实；이다：表示“是”的判断形式；니까：在句末解释原因或依据：“因为、毕竟”。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"거니까","audio":"/audio/1f361968583a107906f4.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"f3901b179742f736","term":"헤엄치다","zh":"游泳，游动，游水","audio":"/audio/f3901b179742f736c701.mp3","entryId":"86984","definition":"人、鱼等为了在水中前进而动四肢或尾部。","pronunciation":["헤엄치다"]},{"id":"b69b8939cafeac28","term":"않다","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/b69b8939cafeac284ca7.mp3","entryId":"17186","definition":"不做某种行动。","pronunciation":["안타"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/c3503566d381fa7c3441.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.942,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=86984","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommo